Package: patrone-notepad
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fonts-patroneos
Description: Notepad: plain text in tabs, for PatroneOS
 Notepad edits plain text files, each in a tab across the top of the
 window, with File, Edit and View menus, find and replace, go to line, word
 wrap, zoom, a choice of font (PatroneOS Mono by default), printing, and a
 light or dark look. Its status bar shows the cursor's line and column, how
 many characters there are, the zoom, and the file's line endings and
 encoding, which it keeps when it saves (UTF-8, UTF-16 and CP1252; LF, CRLF
 and CR).
 .
 By default it keeps the open tabs and their unsaved changes when it closes
 and brings them back the next time, without changing the files; Settings
 turns that off, and Notepad then asks to save changes when it closes. The
 command is notepad.
